{"title":"Badges","slug":"Badges","hero":{"file":"Average_Oaklands_Enjoyer_Badge.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":1146,"revid":21136,"timestamp":"2026-03-16T00:19:57Z","lastEditor":"Tuxedoshlyukha","categories":["Oaklands_Wiki"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"obtainable-badges","text":"Obtainable Badges"},{"id":"rank-badges","text":"Rank Badges"},{"id":"unobtainable-badges","text":"Unobtainable Badges"},{"id":"deprecated-badges","text":"Deprecated Badges"},{"id":"event-badges","text":"Event Badges"}],"body":"<p><b>Badges</b> or <b>Achievements</b>, are accomplishments that the player can obtain in-game. There are a total of 31 achievements that are currently obtainable.\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"obtainable-badges\">Obtainable Badges</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Badges\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481339/Average-Oaklands-Enjoyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Average Oaklands Enjoyer Badge\">Average Oaklands Enjoyer Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Average Oaklands Enjoyer</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for deciding to play Oaklands. Like, you could’ve spent your time on something else, but you decided to play OUR game, even if it was just for a few seconds.\n</td>\n<td>Join the game for the first time.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129537559/Alpha-Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Alpha Player Badge\">Alpha Player Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Alpha Player</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for playing Oaklands during its alpha phase!\n</td>\n<td>Play Oaklands during the alpha phase.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129553249/Superfan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Superfan Badge\">Superfan Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Superfan</p>\n</td>\n<td>No autographs, please!\n</td>\n<td>Be in a server with a developer.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129553252/A-Familiar-Place\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: A Familiar Place Badge\">A Familiar Place Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>⬟ A Familiar Place</p>\n</td>\n<td>It gives off a sense of.. nostalgia.\n</td>\n<td>Find the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Secret_Shack/\">Secret Shack</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129568405/Fresh-Start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Fresh Start Badge\">Fresh Start Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Fresh Start</p>\n</td>\n<td>Now, what do you plan on doing next?\n</td>\n<td>Create a new save slot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579450/Amateur-Woodworker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Amateur Woodworker Badge\">Amateur Woodworker Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Amateur Woodworker</p>\n</td>\n<td>Sometimes, just one type of wood isn’t enough.\n</td>\n<td>Mill one of each tree type.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579451/Amateur-Geologist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Amateur Geologist Badge\">Amateur Geologist Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Amateur Geologist</p>\n</td>\n<td>I mean, they’re very pretty, so I don’t blame you.\n</td>\n<td>Refine / Forge one of each ore type.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579453/Wholesaler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Wholesaler Badge\">Wholesaler Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Wholesaler</p>\n</td>\n<td>That's a lot of bread.\n</td>\n<td>Sell over $25,000 at once.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579456/Burning-Doorway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Burning Doorway Badge\">Burning Doorway Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Burning Doorway</p>\n</td>\n<td>Through the gates of hell.\n</td>\n<td>Complete the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a> puzzle.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129579458/Time-to-Expand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Time to Expand Badge\">Time to Expand Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Time to Expand!</p>\n</td>\n<td>I guess you ran out of room on that small property.\n</td>\n<td>Expand your plot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129596370/Greedy-Land-Buyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Greedy Land Buyer Badge\">Greedy Land Buyer Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Greedy Land Buyer</p>\n</td>\n<td>All your land are now belong to me.\n</td>\n<td>Expand your Property to the max\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129596373/Shoplifter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Shoplifter Badge\">Shoplifter Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Shoplifter</p>\n</td>\n<td>I mean.. it was a worth a shot, I guess?\n</td>\n<td>Bring an item out of a store without paying for it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129596374/Adventurer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Adventurer Badge\">Adventurer Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Adventurer</p>\n</td>\n<td>Maybe you’ll find a few secrets along the way.\n</td>\n<td>Visit all the current landmarks and regions on the map.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/1665995437512298/Blossom-Gates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Blossom Gates Badge\">Blossom Gates Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Blossom Gates</p>\n</td>\n<td>Only granted to the ones who can complete an ultimate quest\n</td>\n<td>Obtain <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Petalfall/\">Petalfall</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/1652075655609193/Spring-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Spring 2024 Badge\">Spring 2024 Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Spring 2024</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for playing this years Oaklands spring update! 🌸\n</td>\n<td>Play during Spring Event 2024.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Teh epik duck\">Teh epik duck</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Teh epik duck\">Teh epik duck</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Tehepikduckbadge.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Teh epik duck</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>It's here.\n</td>\n<td>Complete the glass ducky heist.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"rank-badges\">Rank Badges</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Badges\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481550/Beginner-Lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Beginner Lumberjack Badge\">Beginner Lumberjack Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Beginner Lumberjack</p>\n</td>\n<td>You chopped down a total of 100 trees.\n</td>\n<td>Chop down a total of 100 trees.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481564/Expert-Lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Expert Lumberjack Badge\">Expert Lumberjack Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Expert Lumberjack</p>\n</td>\n<td>You chopped down a total of 1,000 trees.\n</td>\n<td>Chop down a total of 1,000 trees.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481565/Pro-Lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Pro Lumberjack Badge\">Pro Lumberjack Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Pro Lumberjack</p>\n</td>\n<td>You chopped down a total of 10,000 trees.\n</td>\n<td>Chop down a total of 10,000 trees.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481566/Elite-Lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Elite Lumberjack Badge\">Elite Lumberjack Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Elite Lumberjack</p>\n</td>\n<td>You chopped down a total of 100,000 trees! I don’t think MrBeast would be very proud of you, but at least we are.\n</td>\n<td>Chop down a total of 100,000 trees.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481625/Beginner-Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Beginner Miner Badge\">Beginner Miner Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Beginner Miner</p>\n</td>\n<td>You mined a total of 100 rocks / ores.\n</td>\n<td>Mine a total of 100 rocks / ores.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481673/Expert-Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Expert Miner Badge\">Expert Miner Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Expert Miner</p>\n</td>\n<td>You mined a total of 1,000 rocks / ores.\n</td>\n<td>Mine a total of 1,000 rocks / ores.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481674/Pro-Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Pro Miner Badge\">Pro Miner Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Pro Miner</p>\n</td>\n<td>You mined a total of 10,000 rocks / ores.\n</td>\n<td>Mine a total of 10,000 rocks / ores.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129481683/Elite-Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Elite Miner Badge\">Elite Miner Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Elite Miner</p>\n</td>\n<td>You mined a total of 100,000 rocks / ores! If you haven’t found any diamonds at this point. just give up.\n</td>\n<td>Mine a total of 100,000 rocks / ores.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129523453/Beginner-Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Beginner Player Badge\">Beginner Player Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Beginner Player</p>\n</td>\n<td>You reached a total of 24 hours in play time.\n</td>\n<td>Reach a total of 24 hours of playtime.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129523455/Expert-Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Expert Player Badge\">Expert Player Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Expert Player</p>\n</td>\n<td>You reached a total of 72 hours in play time.\n</td>\n<td>Reach a total of 72 hours of playtime.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129523488/Pro-Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Pro Player Badge\">Pro Player Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Pro Player</p>\n</td>\n<td>You reached a total of 216 hours in play time.\n</td>\n<td>Reach a total of 216 hours of playtime.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129524145/Elite-Player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Elite Player Badge\">Elite Player Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Elite Player</p>\n</td>\n<td>You reached a total of 648 hours in play time.\n</td>\n<td>Reach a total of 648 hours of playtime.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129537554/Beginner-Salesperson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Beginner Salesperson Badge\">Beginner Salesperson Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Beginner Salesperson</p> \n</td>\n<td>You sold a total of $10,000 in resources.\n</td>\n<td>Sell a total of 10,000 in resources.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129537555/Expert-Salesperson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Expert Salesperson Badge\">Expert Salesperson Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Expert Salesperson</p> \n</td>\n<td>You sold a total of $100,000 in resources.\n</td>\n<td>Sell a total of $100,000 in resources.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129537556/Pro-Salesperson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Pro Salesperson Badge\">Pro Salesperson Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Pro Salesperson</p>\n</td>\n<td>You sold a total of $1,000,000 in resources.\n</td>\n<td>Sell a total of $1,000,000 in resources.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129537558/Elite-Salesperson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Elite Salesperson Badge\">Elite Salesperson Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Elite Salesperson</p>\n</td>\n<td>You sold a total of $10,000,000 in resources! Now, time to buy a mansion! (assuming you have all that cash still)\n</td>\n<td>Sell a total of $10,000,000 in resources.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"unobtainable-badges\">Unobtainable Badges</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Badges\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129568410/Crash-Dummy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Crash Dummy Badge\">Crash Dummy Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Crash Dummy</p>\n</td>\n<td>They’re supposed to be INSIDE the car, not outside of it.\n</td>\n<td>Hit another player with car so that he flies away. Disabled from being obtained due to apparent performance issues.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"deprecated-badges\">Deprecated Badges</h2>\n<p>These badges are impossible to obtain. They were almost always hidden. Some of them are templates.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Badges\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2127256297/Oaklands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Oaklands Week 1 Badge\">Oaklands Week 1 Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Oaklands Week 1</p>\n</td>\n<td>Wowee- Week 1!? Impressive.\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2127517776/Oaklands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Oaklands Week 2- The Return Badge\">Oaklands Week 2- The Return Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Oaklands Week 2: The Return</p>\n</td>\n<td>Welcome home.<br><br><br><br><br>thanks roblox for tagging the original title so i had to rename it\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2128142596/Oaklands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Oaklands Week 3- Odyssey Badge\">Oaklands Week 3- Odyssey Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Oaklands Week 3: Odyssey</p>\n</td>\n<td>An adventure awaits.\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129553248/Bi-weekly-Tester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Bi-weekly Tester Badge\">Bi-weekly Tester Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>Bi-weekly Tester</p>\n</td>\n<td>Thank you for helping us test out the game during one of our bi-weekly sessions!\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/badges/2129568403/The-Basics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The Basics Badge\">The Basics Badge</span></a></span>\n<p>The Basics</p>\n</td>\n<td>Everyone has to start somewhere.\n</td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"